<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-26T20:40:34.465Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:40:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Algeria has moved to send troops to Niger, marking its first foreign deployment in over 50 years, to protect energy assets against the pro-Russian junta there. In eastern Nigeria gunmen killed at least ten people, while motorbike gunmen killed at least twenty civilians in a village, showing continued attacks on civilians. Mali’s military raised the death toll from a recent attack to fifty-four, indicating intensified fighting. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOSnI5SFhPUVdSMlJIV05qVkh6Qk8zblBnNWRnRGh0Y21QSGd4bDVxSEJjSDlGbG9YV3QtdTN3Q3NRTFlIZUdEX0dFLTNmTkswOHY2Q1BaUzZDekEza2pFalFkdDgwMDRvQzJOSHB4UUg4YWk4TEFoSGNBTnBvaWF1ZEtma2_SAYQBQVVfeXFMT0tueFRSVWNhMEp1aS1RMmFKY1R0NUo5bjRZMWNsYXpBZ3JoUklBc1JWUjhkb3hLT2JRelpvejVocF94WVhiNUM5VkhFSER0RVQxZlpWYkZCdWVUVmlleTUtM3UyU1ZfZ3BFSzNqMU9saEFQV3FYZnRGT3ZPdnhjb0x5RFNk?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE5NRFBLUm4xY3VObEM5VWZJaWVGWjVZSU1ZWTczb21sdzYwZ1FEa2dEakNvSXp4NTlOWFpnbC1XMlhJbDRPNjBPbUFYaGZyYm9YNzIweUJUcGdPazA?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTFBZVWJfRWxaZnRzQkZYcVlXS3oxNFc2dXIyY0o2cjdscjVBcGxycTQ0Y3hQb2VKUE8wUlpweDZVMzdCTTlWUldjSms4c9IBS0FVX3lxTFBZVWJfRWxaZnRzQkZYcVlXS3oxNFc2dXIyY0o2cjdscjVBcGxycTQ0Y3hQb2VKUE8wUlpweDZVMzdCTTlWUldjSms4cw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Наша Ніва&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBV